OL,3,GNEWSACouncil plans next step in city
OL,4,Aexpansion fight
OL,5,
OL,6,FLeicestershire County Council has said
OL,7,Fit is to take the next step towards a
OL,8,Fpotential legal challenge to plans to
OL,9,Fexpand Leicester.
OL,11,FThe Reform UK-led authority said it was
OL,12,Fconcerned that some 250,000 people
OL,13,Fcurrently living in the county face
OL,14,Fbeing moved within the boundary of an
OL,15,Fenlarged Leicester council from 2028.
OL,17,FCouncil leader Dan Harrison said he
OL,18,Fplanned to send a "pre-action protocol"
OL,19,Fletter to the government asking for the
OL,20,Freasoning and evidence supporting the
OL,21,Fdecision it announced in July.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,365,360,200,160,0,100
